    {
      "id": "node-09-challenge",
      "type": "challenge",
      "title": "Mini Challenge: Kalkulator Grade Nilai",
      "xp": 15,
      "instructions": "Buat kalkulator grade yang:\n1. Mengambil nilai dari input dengan id='input-nilai' (angka 0-100)\n2. Saat tombol 'Hitung Grade' diklik:\n   - Jika nilai >= 90: grade 'A', pesan 'Luar biasa!'\n   - Jika nilai >= 80: grade 'B', pesan 'Bagus sekali!'\n   - Jika nilai >= 70: grade 'C', pesan 'Cukup baik.'\n   - Jika nilai >= 60: grade 'D', pesan 'Perlu ditingkatkan.'\n   - Jika di bawah 60: grade 'E', pesan 'Perlu belajar lebih keras.'\n3. Tampilkan grade di id='hasil-grade' dan pesan di id='pesan-grade'\n4. Jika input kosong atau bukan angka, tampilkan pesan error",
      "starterCode": {
        "language": "html",
        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"id\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <title>Kalkulator Grade</title>\n    <style>\n      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 32px; background: #f7fafc; }\n      .kartu { background: #fff; padding: 28px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; max-width: 400px; }\n      h2 { margin-bottom: 20px; color: #1a202c; }\n      label { display: block; font-size: 14px; color: #4a5568; margin-bottom: 6px; font-weight: bold; }\n      input { width: 100%; padding: 10px 14px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 14px; }\n      button { background: #3182ce; color: #fff; border: none; padding: 11px 28px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; }\n      #hasil-grade { font-size: 36px; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 16px; min-height: 44px; }\n      #pesan-grade { font-size: 15px; color: #4a5568; min-height: 24px; }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <div class=\"kartu\">\n      <h2>Kalkulator Grade Nilai</h2>\n      <label for=\"input-nilai\">Nilai (0-100):</label>\n      <input type=\"number\" id=\"input-nilai\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" placeholder=\"Masukkan nilai...\">\n      <button onclick=\"hitungGrade()\">Hitung Grade</button>\n      <p id=\"hasil-grade\"></p>\n      <p id=\"pesan-grade\"></p>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n      // Tulis function hitungGrade() di sini\n\n    </script>\n  </body>\n</html>"
      },
      "expectedResult": "Kalkulator grade yang menampilkan grade A-E dan pesan motivasi sesuai nilai yang dimasukkan.",
      "solution": {
        "language": "html",
        "code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"id\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <title>Kalkulator Grade</title>\n    <style>\n      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 32px; background: #f7fafc; }\n      .kartu { background: #fff; padding: 28px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; max-width: 400px; }\n      h2 { margin-bottom: 20px; color: #1a202c; }\n      label { display: block; font-size: 14px; color: #4a5568; margin-bottom: 6px; font-weight: bold; }\n      input { width: 100%; padding: 10px 14px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 14px; }\n      button { background: #3182ce; color: #fff; border: none; padding: 11px 28px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; }\n      #hasil-grade { font-size: 36px; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 16px; min-height: 44px; }\n      #pesan-grade { font-size: 15px; color: #4a5568; min-height: 24px; }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <div class=\"kartu\">\n      <h2>Kalkulator Grade Nilai</h2>\n      <label for=\"input-nilai\">Nilai (0-100):</label>\n      <input type=\"number\" id=\"input-nilai\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" placeholder=\"Masukkan nilai...\">\n      <button onclick=\"hitungGrade()\">Hitung Grade</button>\n      <p id=\"hasil-grade\"></p>\n      <p id=\"pesan-grade\"></p>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n      function hitungGrade() {\n        var nilaiStr = document.getElementById('input-nilai').value;\n        var hasilGrade = document.getElementById('hasil-grade');\n        var pesanGrade = document.getElementById('pesan-grade');\n\n        if (nilaiStr === '' || isNaN(nilaiStr)) {\n          hasilGrade.textContent = '';\n          pesanGrade.textContent = 'Masukkan angka yang valid (0-100).';\n          pesanGrade.style.color = '#c53030';\n          return;\n        }\n\n        var nilai = parseInt(nilaiStr);\n        var grade, pesan;\n\n        if (nilai >= 90) {\n          grade = 'A'; pesan = 'Luar biasa!';\n        } else if (nilai >= 80) {\n          grade = 'B'; pesan = 'Bagus sekali!';\n        } else if (nilai >= 70) {\n          grade = 'C'; pesan = 'Cukup baik.';\n        } else if (nilai >= 60) {\n          grade = 'D'; pesan = 'Perlu ditingkatkan.';\n        } else {\n          grade = 'E'; pesan = 'Perlu belajar lebih keras.';\n        }\n\n        hasilGrade.textContent = 'Grade: ' + grade;\n        pesanGrade.textContent = pesan;\n        pesanGrade.style.color = '#4a5568';\n      }\n    </script>\n  </body>\n</html>",
        "explanation": "Kita pertama cek apakah input kosong atau bukan angka menggunakan isNaN(). Lalu gunakan else if berantai dari nilai tertinggi ke terendah — urutan ini penting karena kondisi pertama yang true akan dieksekusi."
      }
    },
